1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Most people go straight to two brackets and guess.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Don't guess. Multiply the ends.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Now find two numbers that multiply to negative sixty and add to eleven.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Fifteen and minus four.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Split the middle term. Don't touch anything else.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Group in pairs. Factor each pair.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Same bracket both times. That's how you know it worked.

8
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Here's the trap - if the brackets don't match, your two numbers were wrong, not your method.
